# Ideal State
The swarm executes goals end-to-end with minimal human micromanagement.
All major decisions are logged with rationale and confidence markers.
Every task has clear ownership, acceptance criteria, and rollback path.
Latency remains low while reliability and correctness remain high.
Security gates stay green before and after each release candidate.
Curated memory keeps the Queen aligned with tenant strategy.
Sub-swarms collaborate in parallel without central bottlenecks.
Verified learnings automatically enrich shared knowledge stores.
Operators can audit system behavior in minutes, not hours.
The platform scales cleanly while keeping architecture modular.
